OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust blames 'human error' for
OL,4,Anew baby data loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trust at the centre of the largest
OL,7,Fmaternity scandal in NHS history has
OL,8,Frevealed it lost historical data during
OL,9,Froutine IT work, with police now
OL,10,Fassessing its impact.
OL,12,FMaternity records of women and babies
OL,13,Fwho received care between September
OL,14,F2011 and November 2022 were overwritten
OL,15,Fduring work at Nottingham University
OL,16,FHospitals (NUH) NHS Trust.
OL,18,FInformation has been restored since the
OL,19,F"human error" on 18 August, but the
OL,20,Ftrust has not been able to restore the
OL,21,Fhistory showing who viewed maternity
OL,22,Frecords during this period.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
