OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust blames 'human error' for
OL,4,Anew baby data loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police probe last year into a missing
OL,7,Fdata file containing the details of
OL,8,Fhundreds of maternity cases found it
OL,9,Fwas most likely deleted "intentionally
OL,10,For maliciously".
